[OUTPUT] ## general overview of the project PaintPal is a graphics software application that provides a simple and intuitive interface for digital painting and drawing. It includes a variety of brush tools, color palettes, and layer management features to help artists create stunning digital artwork. With PaintPal, users can easily adjust brush sizes, opacity, and blend modes to achieve the desired artistic effects. The software also allows for easy saving and exporting of artwork in various file formats, making it suitable for both professional artists and hobbyists. ## software functional requirements 1. The application shall offer a variety of brush tools for users to select from. 2. The application shall provide a selection of color palettes for users to choose colors from. 3. The application shall enable layer management features, allowing users to create, delete, and manipulate layers. 4. The application shall allow users to adjust brush sizes to suit their painting needs. 5. The application shall allow users to adjust brush opacity to create different transparency effects. 6. The application shall allow users to change brush blend modes to achieve various artistic effects. 7. The application shall provide functionality for users to save their artwork easily. 8. The application shall allow users to export their artwork in various file formats. [/OUTPUT]
